<title>CANADA: Dominion Textile to buy up to 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Dominion Textile to buy up to 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Textile Inc said on Wednesday it plans to make a normal course issuer bid under which it will buy back up to 2.0 million common shares, or less than five percent of the 41,953,066 outstanding, from November 11 to November 10 next year.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
